      "scenario_id": "AW2",
      "title": "Quality hold without the final-failure guard",
      "scenario": "A non-guard item has retrieval SUCCESS, parser FAILED, DATA_QUALITY, and is placed in DATA_QUALITY_HOLD. It is not an ALERT_DETAIL final retrieval failure.",
